 <iati-activity default-currency="USD" hierarchy="1" iati-activities:version="2.02" linked-data-uri="https://www.iadb.org/en/project/BO-L1031" xml:lang="EN" xmlns:iati-activities="http://d-portal.org/xmlns/iati-activities" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <iati-identifier>XI-IATI-IADB-BO-L1031</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-IADB" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inter-American Development Bank</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Conservacin Vial del Corredor Este-Oeste</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Road Conservation in the East-West Corridor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa BO L1031 es apoyar el aumento de la competitividad del aparato productivo regional y la integracin econmica y social de sus pobladores, mediante la mejora sostenible de las condiciones del transporte de cargas y pasajeros en carreteras de la RVF pavimentada en Bolivia.Los objetivos especficos son: (i) reducir los costos de transporte y tiempo de viaje, mediante la mejora de las condiciones de transitabilidad y de seguridad vial de tramos de rutas prioritarias que conectan sus zonas de produccin con el mercado interno y los pases vecinos, (ii) preservar el patrimonio vial del pas, promoviendo su sostenibilidad mediante el desarrollo e implementacin de controles y mecanismos apropiados de mantenimiento.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the Program BO L1031 is to support the increase of the competitiveness of the productive regional device and the economic and social integration of his settlers, by means of the sustainable progress of the conditions of the transport of containers and passengers in highways of the RVF paved in Bolivia. The specific targets are: the (i)th to reduce the costs of transport and time of trip, by means of the progress of the conditions of transitabilidad and of road safety of stretches of priority routes that connect his zones of production with the internal market and the nearby countries, the (ii)th to preserve the road patrimony of the country, promoting his sostenibilidad by means of the development and implementation of control panel and appropriate mechanisms of maintenance.</narrative>
  </description>
